Output demo/demo-team-init.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1

Hide
Type "source /home/sebastiadev/Escritorio/cortex-cli/demo/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "# Tech Lead — initialize team Claude Code context"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex team init --repo https://github.com/acme/claude-config"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5.5s

Sleep 2s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "# Done — share the repo URL with your team"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "# cortex install --repo https://github.com/acme/claude-config"
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
